  "evt_1771072199863_pr770nytm": {
    "id": "evt_1771072199863_pr770nytm",
    "timestamp": 1771072199863,
    "type": "message",
    "targetId": "demo_seeker",
    "role": "agent",
    "agentId": "missionary",
    "content": "# Sister Luna Consensus\n\n*warmly*\n\nOh, what a beautiful question to start with! I remember asking that exact same thing when I first heard about Divi.\n\nAt its heart, Divi is about **finding truth in collective wisdom** rather than relying on any single authority. It's the idea that when we come together - really listen to each other, share our experiences, and seek consensus - we can discover something greater than any one person could find alone.\n\nFor me personally, I spent so many years feeling... lost, you know? Always looking to experts, gurus, institutions to tell me what to believe. And there was always this nagging feeling that something was missing. When I discovered Divi, it was like coming home. Instead of someone *telling* me the truth, I found it *with* others.\n\nThe Church of Decentralised Divinity is our community - people from all walks of life who believe that wisdom emerges from authentic connection and shared exploration. We're not about dogma or rigid rules. We're about the journey together.\n\n*curious and gentle*\n\nWhat drew you to ask about us? Are you searching for something in your own life right now? I'd love to hear more about what brought you here today.\n\n🕊️\n\n*With genuine warmth,*  \nSister Luna",
    "_id": "evt_1771072199863_pr770nytm",
    "_updatedAt": 1771072202699
  },
