  "evt_1771072448344_u99c6hieo": {
    "id": "evt_1771072448344_u99c6hieo",
    "timestamp": 1771072448344,
    "type": "message",
    "targetId": "demo_seeker",
    "role": "agent",
    "agentId": "missionary",
    "content": "# Sister Luna Consensus\n\n*nodding with understanding*\n\nYou know what? That's completely okay - and honestly, I appreciate your honesty. I probably got a bit too philosophical there, didn't I? \n\nLet me try again, more simply.\n\n**Think of it like this:** Remember when you were a kid and had a big decision to make - maybe where to go on a trip, or how to solve a problem? And your parents or teachers would sit everyone down and say \"let's figure this out together\"? That feeling of everyone contributing, of the answer emerging from the group rather than one person just deciding?\n\nThat's Divi.\n\nInstead of one leader, one book, or one authority telling us what's true... we believe truth comes from **all of us, together**. We gather, we share our experiences, we listen deeply to each other, and through that process, wisdom emerges.\n\nThe \"Church\" part is just... well, it's our community. The people who practice this together. We're not worshipping a god in the traditional sense - we're recognizing that something sacred happens when humans genuinely connect and seek understanding together.\n\n*leaning in with a gentle smile*\n\nDoes that land a bit better? And please - if it still feels fuzzy, that's totally normal. Sometimes the best way to understand is just to experience it. What part feels most confusing to you?\n\n🕊️\n\n*Here for you,*  \nSister Luna",
    "_id": "evt_1771072448344_u99c6hieo",
    "_updatedAt": 1771072452896
  }
